{"_id":"VyLr2vgRVWLgCL99","name":"Corpsesewn Colossus","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/corpsesewn_colossus.webp","items":[{"_id":"lmAtoI0XIKeYA92s","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"t7uK3Gm9w0Ntkx4p","name":"Malfuctioning Furnace","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When thoroughly damaged, the furnace mounted on the corpsesewn colossus's back releases waves of deadly, toxic smoke. When a corpsesewn colossus is reduced to fewer than 100 Hit Points, the smoking furnace mounted to its torso begins to backfire, gradually destroying the colossus and everything around it.</p>\n<p>Each round at the beginning of the corpsesewn colossus's turn, the furnace explodes, dealing [[/r {4d6[fire],4d6[poison]}]]{4d6 fire and 4d6 poison damage} to each creature in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10], including the colossus (@Check[type:reflex|dc:30|name:Malfunctioning Furnace DC|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{basic Reflex} save). This lasts until the next time the corpsesewn colossus is magically repaired.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":null,"actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"69AJpZheJZ9qUzyQ","name":"Maw","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reach-15"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"cq3umb2ct8grh7z3ul81":{"damage":"3d8+16","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":26},"attackEffects":{"value":["improved-grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"KFTkoTDtSR1dPeTx","name":"Fist","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","reach-10"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"qr42u9h6avk9bjiiqt2x":{"damage":"3d6+16","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":26},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"GJiiHsnjjNCr49hp","name":"Blaze a Trail","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The corpsesewn colossus Strides up to its Speed. It can make up to three fist Strikes at any point during its movement.</p>\n<p>Its multiple attack penalty increases after each Strike, as normal.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"G2ighVXEadWJKsuK","name":"Spew Smog","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The corpsesewn colossus vomits forth a wave of noxious, toxic smog that deals [[/r 13d6[poison]]] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:30] (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:32|name:Spew Smog DC|traits:damaging-effect,arcane,evocation,poison|showDC:gm]{basic Fortitude} save). Creatures that fail their save are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>The corpsesewn colossus can't Spew Smog again for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","poison"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.11.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1682702937471,"lastModifiedBy":"KE1JVKM2gVkfdBSm","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"O5kVXZXGwZlgp5VR","name":"Swallow Whole","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Large, [[/r (3d6+6)[bludgeoning]]], Rupture 22.</p>\n<p>If the corpsesewn colossus has at least one creature swallowed whole at the beginning of its turn, the corpsesewn colossus heals [[/r 20[healing]]]{20 HP}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwallowWhole]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"swallow-whole","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.uJSseLa57HZYSMUu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"pkdSoD1kUFk5q8Av","name":"Improved Grab","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-grab","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.i18TlebMzwONyPhI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":270,"temp":0,"max":270,"details":""},"ac":{"value":31,"details":"","base":31},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","label":"Climb","value":30}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"doomed"},{"type":"drained"},{"type":"fatigued"},{"type":"healing"},{"type":"mental"},{"type":"nonlethal-attacks"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"sickened"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"type":"fire","value":10}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":12},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>A corpsesewn colossus is a nightmarish machine of flesh and steel, animated from the bones and flesh of untold masses and powered by a nightmarish engine of iron and steel. The horrific construct's body is sutured skin and twitching limbs that terminate in an enormous maw filled with clanking metal teeth, while two massive arms pull the behemoth along. While it may initially seem animated by necromantic powers or undead magic, the corpsesewn colossus is actually powered by a massive, rumbling, smog-spewing machine attached to the back of its worm-like body.</p>\n<p>Though their missions vary by the crafter, corpsesewn colossi tend not to have a much greater purpose than to scour the land in search of ever more bodies to consume in order to fuel their own hellish engine. In this way, they are perpetual murder machines: powered by death only so that they may inflict yet more death. Despite this, corpsesewn colossi are sometimes tasked with searching mass burial grounds or fields of war for specific corpses, such as notable commanders or heroes. When so commanded, a colossus will dutifully shovel this body into a special compartment in order to bring it back, as whole as possible, to its master.</p>\n<h2>Crafted Under a Banner of Cruelty</h2>\n<p>Corpsesewn colossi are typically created by deranged alchemists and wizards, and often only by those innovators who have already mastered the art of smaller such monstrosities like flesh golems and skinstitches. Still, it takes a special mind to craft (or to even concoct in the first place) this particular brand of horror. Perhaps, then, it only makes sense that corpsesewn colossi are more common in war-torn nations, where scruples tend to be as scant as corpses are prevalent.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Corpsesewn Colossus Creature 12 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 250/560/1,030 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (fire, negative, positive), evil, fire, poison, sensory (darkvision), strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Mitchell German","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":0},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":26,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":22},"athletics":{"base":26}},"traits":{"value":["construct","evil","mindless"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":3,"width":3,"disposition":-1,"name":"Corpsesewn Colossus","actorLink":false,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"bar2":{"attribute":null},"randomImg":false,"light":{"alpha":0.25,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"type":null,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"color":null,"attenuation":0.5,"negative":false,"priority":0},"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/Tokens/corpsesewn_colossus.webp","tint":"#ffffff","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"visionMode":"basic","color":